{
  "name": "claude-in-dsh",
  "version": "1.5.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness web 插件：把一个会话交给本机 Claude Code CLI 驱动。引擎选择器（DSH|Claude）、Claude 权限档替换访问模式、Claude 模型/effort 选择、原生工具卡片与子 agent 嵌套、dsh 原生审批、命令面板并入 Claude 命令（一次性命令带外执行）、订阅用量读数、导入本机 Claude 对话。Claude 进程由独立 broker 持有，插件更新与 dsh 重启都不中断它。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/broker.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.plugin.json",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "install.sh"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/GeekRicardo/claude-in-dsh"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
